# No push

Do not run `git push` on the main tool repository unless the human explicitly asks.

The GitHub wiki checkout at `wiki/` is the exception. After wiki pages change, commit that nested repository and push it to the wiki remote. See `wiki-sync`.

Adding a remote, committing locally, and opening a PR URL for the human is allowed.
